# An allow-list: the image needs only the lock file, the config and the package (and the MCP
# server's target the documents it serves and the dashboard's drawing). Above all, no .env
# file, var/ data or local virtualenv may reach the build context.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!config/
!src/
!README.md
!docs/runbook.md
!docs/backtests/portfolio.md
!web/chart.js
!web/chart.css
src/**/__pycache__
